# GüvenPoliçe API — REST Client (VS Code) / JetBrains HTTP Client
# Refresh token httpOnly cookie'dir; istemcinin cookie jar'ı otomatik taşır.
@api = http://localhost:8080
@password = Demo-Parola-2026

### Sağlık
GET {{api}}/health

### Kimliksiz metrik isteği → 401
GET {{api}}/metrics

### Giriş (acente)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "acente@guvenpolice.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Oturumdaki kullanıcı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Müşteriler (AGENT/UNDERWRITER)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/customers?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Refresh (cookie ile)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Çıkış
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Yanlış parola → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "acente@guvenpolice.test", "password": "yanlis"}

### Geçerli tarife (başlangıç tarihine göre)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tariffs/active?product=KASKO&date=2026-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Teklif önizleme (kaydetmez) — customer_id: demo Ayşe Demir
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": 1, "product": "KASKO", "term_start": "2026-11-01", "ncd_level": 2, "vehicle_group": "C", "plate": "34ABC123", "coverages": ["KASKO_ANA", "CAM"]}

### Teklif kaydet
# @name quote
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": 1, "product": "KASKO", "term_start": "2026-11-01", "ncd_level": 2, "vehicle_group": "C", "plate": "34ABC123", "coverages": ["KASKO_ANA", "CAM"]}

### Teklif listesi / detayı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/quotes?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quote.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Poliçeye çevir (aynı anahtarla tekrar → aynı yanıt, Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quote.response.body.id}}/convert
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-convert-1

### Poliçe listesi
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Underwriter girişi
# @name uw
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "underwriter@guvenpolice.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Onay bekleyen teklifler
GET {{api}}/api/v1/quotes?status=UW_REVIEW
Authorization: Bearer {{uw.response.body.access_token}}

### Underwriter kararı (id'yi listeden alın)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{uw.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "APPROVE", "note": "uygun"}

### --- A3: poliçe detayı, zeyil, iptal (poliçe id'sini listeden alın) ---

### Poliçe detayı (sürümler, teminatlar, zeyiller, prim özeti)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### B2 — poliçe PDF özeti → 200 application/pdf; attachment; Cache-Control: private, no-store
# Detay ucunun verisiyle aynı; taksit, faktör dökümü ve TCKN yok.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/pdf

### B2 — kimliksiz PDF isteği → 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/pdf

### B2 — eksper girişi
# @name pdfAppraiser
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "eksper@guvenpolice.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### B2 — eksper PDF isteği → 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{pdfAppraiser.response.body.access_token}}

### Tarihte geçerli teminat (dönem dışı veya iptal sonrası → 404 NO_COVERAGE_ON_DATE)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/coverage?date=2027-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Araç değişikliği önizleme (kaydetmez)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/endorsements/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"effective_date": "2027-02-10", "vehicle_group": "D", "plate": "06ABC42", "base_version_no": 1}

### Araç değişikliği zeyli (aynı anahtarla tekrar → aynı yanıt)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/endorsements
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-zeyil-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"effective_date": "2027-02-10", "vehicle_group": "D", "plate": "06ABC42", "base_version_no": 1}

### Limit düşürme (kullanılanın altına → 422 LIMIT_BELOW_USAGE)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/endorsements/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"effective_date": "2027-03-01", "coverage_limits": {"KASKO_ANA": 120000000}}

### İptal önizleme — müşteri talebi (kısa dönem)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/cancel/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"effective_date": "2027-05-15", "reason": "CUSTOMER_REQUEST", "note": "araç satıldı"}

### İptal — acente yalnızca CUSTOMER_REQUEST (UNDERWRITER gerekçesi → 403)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-iptal-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"effective_date": "2027-05-15", "reason": "CUSTOMER_REQUEST", "note": "araç satıldı"}

### İptal önizleme — underwriter, şirket kaynaklı (gün esaslı)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/policies/1/cancel/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{uw.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"effective_date": "2027-05-15", "reason": "UNDERWRITER"}

### A4 — güncel tarih ve bugün başlayan poliçe id'sini girin (gelecekte hasar reddedilir)
@lossDate = 2026-10-25
@claimPolicyId = 1

### Hasar uzmanı girişi
# @name adjuster
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"hasar@guvenpolice.test","password":"{{password}}"}

### Eksper girişi
# @name appraiser
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"eksper@guvenpolice.test","password":"{{password}}"}

### Muhasebe girişi
# @name accounting
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"muhasebe@guvenpolice.test","password":"{{password}}"}

### Metrikler — ACCOUNTING/UNDERWRITER; diğer roller 403
GET {{api}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}

### Hasar bildir (aynı anahtarla tekrar aynı yanıt)
# @name claim
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-claim-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"policy_id":{{claimPolicyId}},"coverage_code":"CAM","loss_date":"{{lossDate}}","description":"Örnek cam kırılması","claimed_amount_kurus":2000000}

### Dosya listesi, durum filtresi ve keyset
GET {{api}}/api/v1/claims?status=REPORTED&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}

### Dosya detayı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}

### Ön inceleme
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to_status":"TRIAGED","expected_row_version":1,"note":"Ön inceleme tamam"}

### Ekspertize gönder
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to_status":"APPRAISAL","expected_row_version":2}

### Ekspertiz ekle — aynı anahtar çökme sonrasında da aynı kayıt/201 döndürür
# Farklı ekspertiz için farklı anahtar; aynı anahtarla farklı içerik → 422.
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/appraisals
Idempotency-Key: demo-appraisal-1
Authorization: Bearer {{appraiser.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"damage_amount_kurus":2000000,"is_total_loss":false,"notes":"Cam değişimi","inspected_at":"{{lossDate}}T12:00:00+03:00"}

### Tazminat değerlendirmesine al
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to_status":"ADJUSTMENT","expected_row_version":3}

### Tazminat önizleme (CAM: 2000000 - 50000 = 1950000)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/settlement/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}

### Tazminat onayı (aynı anahtarla tekrar denenebilir)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/settlement/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-claim-approve-1

### Tazminat ödemesi (aynı anahtarla tekrar denenebilir)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-claim-pay-1

### Dosyayı kapat
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to_status":"CLOSED","expected_row_version":6}

### A5 — üç taksitle çevir (yeni CALCULATED/APPROVED teklif id'sini yaz)

# @name a5convert
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quote.response.body.id}}/convert
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: a5-convert-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"installment_count":3}

### Plan, taksit, faiz, tahsis ve iadeler
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies/{{a5convert.response.body.id}}/billing
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}

### Tahsilat (CUSTOMER kendi poliçesinde payment_date göndermez)

# @name a5payment
POST {{api}}/api/v1/policies/{{a5convert.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: a5-payment-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount_kurus":10000,"method":"TRANSFER"}

### İade — yukarıdaki PAYMENT id'sini yaz
POST {{api}}/api/v1/payments/{{a5payment.response.body.id}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: a5-refund-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount_kurus":1000,"reason":"Kurgusal demo iadesi"}

### Gün sonu (as_of verilmezse bugün)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/billing/run
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Mizan ve alacak mutabakatı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/ledger/trial-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}

### Satırlarıyla yevmiye listesi; next_cursor ile sonraki sayfa
GET {{api}}/api/v1/journal-entries?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}

### A6 — Fraud kuyruğu (hasar uzmanı token)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/claim-tasks?status=open&task_type=FRAUD_REVIEW
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}

### A6 — İhlal görevleri (eksper tokenıyla yalnız kendi görevleri)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/claim-tasks?status=open&breached=true&claim_id={{claim.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{appraiser.response.body.access_token}}

### A6 — İş yükü / SLA özeti
GET {{api}}/api/v1/claim-tasks/workload
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/claim-tasks/sla-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}

### A6 — İncelemeden ekspertize (güncel row_version kullanın)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/claims/{{claim.response.body.id}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{adjuster.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to_status":"APPRAISAL","expected_row_version":3,"note":"Kurgusal inceleme tamamlandı"}

### A6 — Yazılan prim raporu: bitiş günü hariç, sınırlar isteğe bağlı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/production?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-11-01&group_by=agent
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}

### A7 — tüm giriş yapmış roller: sayısal canlılık ve son simülasyon
GET {{api}}/api/v1/system/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}

### A7 — imleçli gün sonu; done=false ise next_after_policy_id ile tekrarla
POST {{api}}/api/v1/billing/run
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"limit":25,"after_policy_id":0}

### B1 — varsayılan son 12 ay; yalnız acentenin kendi satırı, total yok
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### B1 — tüm zamanlar, bütün acenteler + Acentesiz + toplam
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/agents?from=&to=
Authorization: Bearer {{accounting.response.body.access_token}}

### B1 — başlangıç dahil, bitiş hariç
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/agents?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-10-01
Authorization: Bearer {{uw.response.body.access_token}}

### B1 — kimliksiz 401
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/agents

### B1 — müşteri girişi
# @name b1customer
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"musteri@guvenpolice.test","password":"{{password}}"}

### B1 — müşteri 403
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{b1customer.response.body.access_token}}

### B1 — parametreyle kapsam genişlemez; yine yalnız kendi acentesi, total yok
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/agents?from=&to=&agent_id=unassigned&include_total=true
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
